#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/owners.md:10
msgid "Serialized owners and final-access observers"
msgstr "串行化所有者与最终访问观察者"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/owners.md:12
msgid ""
"Owners serialize selected I/O operations using caller-owned bounded storage."
" Final request access, owner idleness, observer withdrawal and external "
"executor joins are separate shutdown conditions."
msgstr ""
"所有者通过调用者拥有的有界存储串行化所选 I/O 操作。请求最终访问、所有者空闲、观察者撤回以及外部执行器 join，是相互独立的停机条件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/owners.md:16
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/owners.md:18
msgid "bus_owner.h"
msgstr "bus_owner.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/runtime/owners.md:20
msgid "Explicit bounded multi-producer, single-executor adapter."
msgstr "显式、有界的多生产者、单执行者适配器。"

